 <rdf:Description rdf:about=''
  xmlns:dc='http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/'>
  <dc:description>
   <rdf:Alt>
    <rdf:li xml:lang='x-default'>A black silhouette depicts a modern office desk with a computer monitor, mouse, and a pen holder filled with writing instruments. An ergonomic office chair with wheels is placed in front of the desk, ready for use. The minimalist design suggests a workspace, professional environment, or home office setup.</rdf:li>
   </rdf:Alt>
  </dc:description>
